      "text": "PRINCIPLE\n\nThe deterministic frontier crawl\nstays the EXECUTOR.\n\nAn agentic shell feeds it seeds\nfrom a 3-tier source ladder,\ncheapest+most-trusted first.\n\nEvery fact cited · nothing\nungrounded · human prunes.",
